{"synopsis":"Setelah menentang cengkeraman kematian, Yu Lin membangunkan “Sistem Tycoon Ilahi”, yang memberinya pembayaran tunai harian. Namun ada kendalanya: uang tersebut adalah Token Nether yang tidak dapat digunakan. Bertahun-tahun kemudian, dia terpilih sebagai salah satu dari sedikit orang yang beruntung yang melakukan uji beta Global Menace, sebuah game horor di mana hanya yang terbaik dan terkuat yang bisa bertahan. Sementara yang lain dengan panik menenangkan roh-roh jahat, Yu Lin merekrut pengikut hantu yang setia dengan pengeluaran Tycoon-nya. Sepertinya hanya punya uang saja yang kamu perlukan untuk menguasai dunia bawah!","alternative_title":"全球惊悚：开局万亿冥币 开局万亿冥币","author":"季米","artist":"青鸿文化, 飞卢小说网","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"46b90106-c8ef-491e-b4ff-ca7cc65af1d3","number":"255","chapter":"255","title":"Chapter 255","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"23c24625-be58-4e81-898c-b2fc98374404","number":"254","chapter":"254","title":"Chapter 254","date":"2026-07-27","released":"2026-07-27","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"1e762cf1-5676-4eb4-a1b6-699bfbb28aae","number":"253","chapter":"253","title":"Chapter 253","date":"2026-07-24","released":"2026-07-24","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"f7e94afc-6908-4c95-b262-5d786d6e784a","number":"252","chapter":"252","title":"Chapter 252","date":"2026-07-21","released":"2026-07-21","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"59f6073a-f6b9-471f-bcdb-0726bfdf5bba","number":"251","chapter":"251","title":"Chapter 251","date":"2026-07-18","released":"2026-07-18","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"1d00695b-8ab6-45b4-b584-a5482d2f3a1a","number":"250","chapter":"250","title":"Chapter 250","date":"2026-07-14","released":"2026-07-14","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"a832ad9b-61d1-4bed-a74a-f4a880bf4060","number":"249","chapter":"249","title":"Chapter 249","date":"2026-07-10","released":"2026-07-10","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"3d411937-7d68-45f6-89c9-3ce59227f2c4","number":"248","chapter":"248","title":"Chapter 248","date":"2026-07-06",